<title>UK: Thorn off on negative press, broker comment.</title>
<headline>Thorn off on negative press, broker comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Thorn Plc sank on Tuesday, reversing all it gained yesterday, following negative comments in the press and from brokerage BZW, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1148 GMT, the shares were down 15p to 188.</p>
</text>
